sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Owner A (seller)
  actor B as Owner B (buyer)
  actor R as RTO
  participant C as VehicleRegistry
  participant N as VehicleNFT
  A->>C: initiateTransfer(vin, B)
  C->>C: caller is owner, B valid, not stolen, no active loan, none pending
  C-->>B: emit TransferInitiated (notification badge)
  B->>C: acceptTransfer(vin)
  C-->>R: emit TransferAccepted (shows in approval queue)
  R->>C: approveTransfer(vin)
  C->>C: buyer accepted? still not stolen / no loan?
  C->>C: close A's ownership record, open B's
  C->>N: move(A, B, tokenId)
  C-->>A: emit OwnershipTransferred(vin, A, B)
  Note over A,B: Either party may cancelTransfer(vin) before approval
